  "question": {
    "text": "<p>Which of the following reactions are disproportionation reactions?</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo> </mo><msup><mi>Cu</mi><mo>+</mo></msup><mo>→</mo><msup><mi>Cu</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>Cu</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced><mtext> </mtext><mn>3</mn><msubsup><mi>MnO</mi><mn>4</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>+</mo></msup><mo>→</mo><mn>2</mn><msubsup><mi>MnO</mi><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>MnO</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mn>3</mn></mfenced><mo> </mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>KMnO</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><mo>→</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi>MnO</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>MnO</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mn>4</mn></mfenced><mo> </mo><mn>2</mn><msubsup><mi>MnO</mi><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo></msubsup><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>Mn</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mo>→</mo><mn>5</mn><msub><mi>MnO</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>+</mo></msup></math></p><p>Choose the correct answer from the options given below:</p>",
    "image": null
